{"4159780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CxC", "steam_appid": 4159780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/d7397df44194cbb5709efcefeb0a54da.webp?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/48f1fd6f1a1b1c349d2379e7942c6d23.poster.avif?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/48f1fd6f1a1b1c349d2379e7942c6d23.webm?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/48f1fd6f1a1b1c349d2379e7942c6d23.mp4?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pictures have escaped your computer and materialized across different dimensions. Every level is generated from a 100x100 .png image, where various pixel colors correspond to different game objects and mechanics, such as player start position, jump pads, enemies, their movement trajectories, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/d1eeb9373ba5b83bd0f165b5bf65bbf5.webp?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/1bdd32c577fd132dbf41c3e8dc9582a9.poster.avif?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/1bdd32c577fd132dbf41c3e8dc9582a9.webm?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/1bdd32c577fd132dbf41c3e8dc9582a9.mp4?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the pictures and dodge obstacles in style using your dash ability, along with a variety of mechanics that facilitate your traversal such as jump pads, pinball bumpers, air currents and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/5a38362aaea1042e5186c6510f0dc0c9.webp?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/0184b3bd06858446005a62df16608543.poster.avif?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/0184b3bd06858446005a62df16608543.webm?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/0184b3bd06858446005a62df16608543.mp4?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Any drawing software is your level editor!</strong></i> Just draw a 100x100 image in the software of your choice, save it as .png, drag and drop it into the Documents folder, and then it will show up in the list of custom levels! Whether you want to draw a piece of pixel art, or resize a photograph and play around with it, your imagination is the limit (and 10000 pixels).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/b27fd8f2e6e4505de6f4489d1ed034ae.webp?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=30 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are generated at run-time from 100x100 .png images</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a pixel art collection that came to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your own 100x100 images as custom levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging movement mechanics and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple themes, like the city and desert worlds</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/d7397df44194cbb5709efcefeb0a54da.webp?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/48f1fd6f1a1b1c349d2379e7942c6d23.poster.avif?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/48f1fd6f1a1b1c349d2379e7942c6d23.webm?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/48f1fd6f1a1b1c349d2379e7942c6d23.mp4?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pictures have escaped your computer and materialized across different dimensions. Every level is generated from a 100x100 .png image, where various pixel colors correspond to different game objects and mechanics, such as player start position, jump pads, enemies, their movement trajectories, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/d1eeb9373ba5b83bd0f165b5bf65bbf5.webp?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/1bdd32c577fd132dbf41c3e8dc9582a9.poster.avif?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/1bdd32c577fd132dbf41c3e8dc9582a9.webm?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/1bdd32c577fd132dbf41c3e8dc9582a9.mp4?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the pictures and dodge obstacles in style using your dash ability, along with a variety of mechanics that facilitate your traversal such as jump pads, pinball bumpers, air currents and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/5a38362aaea1042e5186c6510f0dc0c9.webp?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/0184b3bd06858446005a62df16608543.poster.avif?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/0184b3bd06858446005a62df16608543.webm?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/0184b3bd06858446005a62df16608543.mp4?t=1785575107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Any drawing software is your level editor!</strong></i> Just draw a 100x100 image in the software of your choice, save it as .png, drag and drop it into the Documents folder, and then it will show up in the list of custom levels! Whether you want to draw a piece of pixel art, or resize a photograph and play around with it, your imagination is the limit (and 10000 pixels).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/extras/b27fd8f2e6e4505de6f4489d1ed034ae.webp?t=1785575107\" width=600 height=30 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels are generated at run-time from 100x100 .png images</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a pixel art collection that came to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your own 100x100 images as custom levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging movement mechanics and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple themes, like the city and desert worlds</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "CxC is a platformer where each level is generated from a 100x100 .png image. Navigate through a pixel art collection that came to life, and also import and play on your own pictures!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/45407e1bfcd7ec1e5871df5fd8a3b75f03167580/header.jpg?t=1785575107", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/c9fcc9e7f813fb0a951190a1c5b6909b482c0f07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785575107", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159780/c9fcc9e7f813fb0a951190a1c5b6909b482c0f07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785575107", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4690K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong